{"name":"Paloma","hex":"#9f9c99","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Paloma","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Paloma"}],"entries":[{"title":"Paloma (cocktail)","blocks":[{"text":"The paloma is a tequila-based cocktail. This drink is most commonly prepared by mixing tequila, lime juice, and a grapefruit-flavored soda such as Fresca, Squirt, or Jarritos and served with ice and a lime wedge. Adding salt to the rim of the glass is also an option."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg/330px-Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paloma_(cocktail)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg/500px-Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg/1280px-Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg/500px-Paloma_Cocktail2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APaloma_Cocktail2.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}